WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:09.250
In Manage hosting, open Databases, and click New database.

2
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.707
Enter a database name and a user name.

3
00:00:11.707 --> 00:00:15.550
Your account prefix is added for you.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.587
Click Generate for a strong password, and save it somewhere safe.

5
00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:23.150
Then click Create database.

6
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.075
Connect your app using localhost, with the new name, user, and password.
